# The deployment image is assembly-only (.github/docker/Dockerfile): it needs
# the built war, the error page and the branding files, nothing else. Without
# this the build context would carry the client's node_modules and the whole
# maven target tree.
*
!.github/docker/brand/
!cds-tcamt/error.html
!cds-tcamt/cds-tcamt-controller/target/fits.war
